Hi, I am Jaap Schouwenburg. I'm learning about Lojban from Lojban for Beginners.


That's about all I can manage in Lojban, and I probably messed that up too (:smile:). I'm very new to Lojban, and have only worked upto possesives in the Lojban for Beginners course. I find the concept of Lojban very interesting, and it's a fun language to learn. I look forward to actually being able to read simple sentences without constantly referring to word lists and grammar guides (:smile:). 

